# Docker build scratch
#   ``sdk-local/`` is created by CI (or a developer running a local Docker
#   build) to vendor the in-tree ``cyberwave-sdks/cyberwave-python`` source
#   into the image when the published wheel on PyPI is too old. The
#   Dockerfile's ``COPY sdk-local`` requires the directory to exist, so CI
#   runs ``mkdir -p sdk-local`` before the build — see
#   ``.github/workflows/edge-node-camera-depth-estimation-driver-test-and-push.yml``.
#   Its contents are pure build scratch and must never be committed.
sdk-local/
